WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.440
Another thing Dr. Bright is not&nbsp;
allowed to do at the Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:07.360
"Challenge Accepted" is not&nbsp;
a valid excuse for anything!

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:12.400
Just because someone speaks hyperbolically around&nbsp;
you, or uses a figure of speech, that does not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.840
mean you should say "Challenge Accepted!" and take&nbsp;
it as an invitation to act on whatever was said.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:22.800
This includes, but is not limited to, "I'm&nbsp;
so hungry I could eat a horse," "I'm drowning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:28.080
in paperwork," "These new shoes are killing&nbsp;
me," and "That's so cute I could just die."

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:33.600
Accepting a hypothetical challenge is also not&nbsp;
an excuse to: Flood the canteen with hot coffee,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:39.440
attempt to reverse the polarity of gravity, or&nbsp;
attempt to get SCP-682 to smile. It is not a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:43.360
"get out of jail free" card,&nbsp;
Dr. Bright. You will go to jail.

